# Copy to `.env` for local development. Neither file belongs in the repo.

# Where the enquiry form posts. Defaults to /submit, which is the Cloudflare
# Pages Function in `functions/submit.js`. `vite dev` and `vite preview` do not
# run Pages Functions, so a plain `npm run dev` will fail the send and show the
# form's error state — that is expected. Use `npx wrangler pages dev dist` to
# exercise the real endpoint.
VITE_ENQUIRY_ENDPOINT=/submit

# RESEND_API_KEY is NOT set here. It is a Cloudflare Pages environment variable,
# read by the Function at request time. It must never be committed.
